# Release signing — never commit the keystore or its passwords.
# Back these up somewhere safe outside this repo: losing them means no
# future release build can ever be signed to match this app's identity,
# and every device that installed a build signed with this key would be
# unable to receive an in-place update.
keystore.properties
/keystore/
